### 1. REGISTER
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. LOGIN (Kopyahin ang token na lalabas dito)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. CREATE STUDENT (I-paste ang token sa Authorization, tapos kopyahin ang ID na lalabas)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YWVhMWJiYzQ1N2E4NGEyNGU3MmQwMTciLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc5MzcyOTU4MCwiZXhwIjoxNzkzNzMzMTgwfQ.3tLhGahaRPyigtg0ryrvkTok23Pf9ylCqX_UuHSLrK8

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "age": 20,
  "isActive": true
}

### 4. GET STUDENTS WITH TOKEN (I-paste ang token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YWVhMWJiYzQ1N2E4NGEyNGU3MmQwMTciLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc5MzcyOTU4MCwiZXhwIjoxNzkzNzMzMTgwfQ.3tLhGahaRPyigtg0ryrvkTok23Pf9ylCqX_UuHSLrK8

### 5. DELETE STUDENT (I-paste ang token at ang ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/students/6aea250739502fe6b58c460a
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YWVhMWJiYzQ1N2E4NGEyNGU3MmQwMTciLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc5MzcyOTU4MCwiZXhwIjoxNzkzNzMzMTgwfQ.3tLhGahaRPyigtg0ryrvkTok23Pf9ylCqX_UuHSLrK8
### 6. GET WITHOUT TOKEN (Dapat 401 error)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students